OL,3,GNEWSATrees snapped by vandals at
OL,4,Acountry park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaplings at a country park have been
OL,7,Fsnapped by vandals.
OL,9,FRangers at Colwick Country Park
OL,10,Fdiscovered on Sunday that
OL,11,Frecently-planted trees at the green
OL,12,Fspace, off Daleside Road in Nottingham,
OL,13,Fhad been damaged.
OL,15,FDamage was also caused "in other areas
OL,16,Fand facilities within the park"
OL,17,Fovernight, Nottingham City Council
OL,18,Fadded.
OL,20,FIt said the incident had been reported
OL,21,Fto Nottinghamshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
